    "description": "<p>This spell instantly destroys one magical barrier created by a cleric. It can also dispel certain barriers created by a magic-user.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> <em>Remove Barrier</em> will destroy a cleric's <em>Barrier</em> spell and can also dispel the following magic-user spells:</p><ul><li><em>Wall of Ice</em></li><li><em>Wall of Fire</em></li><li><em>Clothform</em></li><li><em>Woodform</em></li><li><em>Wall of Stone</em></li></ul><p><strong>Limitations:</strong> This spell does <em>not</em> affect the following spells: <em>Wall of Iron</em>, <em>Stoneform</em>, <em>Ironform</em>, or <em>Steelform</em>.</p>",
